    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Build a full-stack mock online banking web app called \"AdrieChartered\" using Next.js App Router and MongoDB (via Mongoose). No Supabase, no Firebase. This is a UK-based bank.\n\n## Tech Stack\n- Next.js 14 (App Router)\n- MongoDB + Mongoose for database\n- NextAuth.js for session management\n- Nodemailer for sending OTP emails\n- Twilio for sending OTP via SMS\n- Twilio WhatsApp Business API for sending OTP via WhatsApp\n- Tailwind CSS for styling\n- React Hook Form + Zod for form validation\n- All environment variables in .env.local\n\n---\n\n## Design & Branding\n- Color scheme: light blue (#4A90D9, #E8F4FD) and white\n- Logo: \"AC\" monogram + \"AdrieChartered\" wordmark\n- Tagline: \"Banking Built Around You\"\n- Clean, modern, mobile-first UK banking UI\n- Smooth transitions, card shadows, professional feel\n- Sans-serif typography (Inter)\n- UK-style formatting throughout (DD/MM/YYYY dates, UK sort codes)\n\n---\n\n## Currency System\n- User selects preferred display currency on signup\n- Available currencies (NO African currencies):\n  - \360\237\207\254\360\237\207\247 GBP \342\200\224 British Pound Sterling (\302\243) [default]\n  - \360\237\207\272\360\237\207\270 USD \342\200\224 US Dollar ($)\n  - \360\237\207\252\360\237\207\272 EUR \342\200\224 Euro (\342\202\254)\n  - \360\237\207\250\360\237\207\255 CHF \342\200\224 Swiss Franc (CHF)\n  - \360\237\207\250\360\237\207\246 CAD \342\200\224 Canadian Dollar (CA$)\n  - \360\237\207\246\360\237\207\272 AUD \342\200\224 Australian Dollar (A$)\n  - \360\237\207\257\360\237\207\265 JPY \342\200\224 Japanese Yen (\302\245)\n  - \360\237\207\246\360\237\207\252 AED \342\200\224 UAE Dirham (AED)\n  - \360\237\207\270\360\237\207\254 SGD \342\200\224 Singapore Dollar (S$)\n  - \360\237\207\263\360\237\207\277 NZD \342\200\224 New Zealand Dollar (NZ$)\n  - \360\237\207\270\360\237\207\252 SEK \342\200\224 Swedish Krona (kr)\n  - \360\237\207\263\360\237\207\264 NOK \342\200\224 Norwegian Krone (kr)\n  - \360\237\207\251\360\237\207\260 DKK \342\200\224 Danish Krone (kr)\n  - \360\237\207\250\360\237\207\263 CNY \342\200\224 Chinese Yuan (\302\245)\n  - \360\237\207\255\360\237\207\260 HKD \342\200\224 Hong Kong Dollar (HK$)\n- Currency preference saved to user profile in MongoDB\n- User can change currency anytime from Profile page\n- All balances and transactions display in selected currency symbol\n- Styled dropdown with flag emoji + currency code + full name\n\n---\n\n## OTP Delivery \342\200\224 User Chooses Method\n\n### On Sign Up & Login:\n- After submitting credentials, user lands on OTP Method Selection screen\n- User picks ONE of three delivery methods:\n  - \360\237\223\247 Email \342\200\224 OTP sent via Nodemailer to their registered email\n  - \360\237\222\254 WhatsApp \342\200\224 OTP sent via Twilio WhatsApp API to their phone number\n  - \360\237\223\261 SMS \342\200\224 OTP sent via Twilio SMS to their phone number\n- If WhatsApp or SMS is selected, user must have entered a phone number\n- Phone number field on signup (with country code selector, UK +44 default)\n- OTP is 6 digits, expires in 10 minutes\n- OTP hashed before storing in MongoDB\n\n### OTP Method Selection Screen (/verify-method)\n- Three large selectable cards:\n  - \360\237\223\247 \"Send to my Email\" \342\200\224 shows masked email (ad***@gmail.com)\n  - \360\237\222\254 \"Send via WhatsApp\" \342\200\224 shows masked phone (+44 **** **789)\n  - \360\237\223\261 \"Send via SMS\" \342\200\224 shows masked phone (+44 **** **789)\n- \"Continue\" button triggers OTP send to chosen method\n- Routes to /verify page after sending\n\n### OTP Verification Page (/verify)\n- Shows which method was used (e.g. \"We sent a code to your WhatsApp\")\n- 6 individual digit input boxes\n- Auto-focus next box on input\n- Auto-submit on last digit entry\n- Resend OTP button with 60s countdown (resends via same method)\n- \"Change delivery method\" link \342\206\222 back to /verify-method\n\n### OTP Message Templates\n\n**Email subject:** Your AdrieChartered Verification Code\n**Email body:**\n  \"Hi [Full Name],\n  Your AdrieChartered verification code is:\n  [BIG BOLD 6-DIGIT CODE]\n  This code expires in 10 minutes. Do not share it with anyone.\n  If you did not request this, please ignore this email.\n  \342\200\224 AdrieChartered Security Team\"\n\n**WhatsApp / SMS message:**\n  \"AdrieChartered Security Code: [CODE]\n  Valid for 10 minutes. Never share this code with anyone.\n  AdrieChartered \342\200\224 Banking Built Around You\"\n\n---\n\n## Database Models (MongoDB + Mongoose)\n\n### User Model\n- fullName, email, password (bcrypt hashed)\n- phone (with country code, e.g. +447911123456)\n- accountNumber (auto-generated 10-digit unique number on signup)\n- sortCode (auto-generated UK-style sort code e.g. 40-22-15)\n- currency (default: \"GBP\")\n- balance (default: 0)\n- isVerified (boolean)\n- otp (string, hashed), otpExpiry (date)\n- otpMethod (last used: \"email\" | \"whatsapp\" | \"sms\")\n- createdAt\n\n### Transaction Model\n- userId (ref: User)\n- type: \"credit\" | \"debit\"\n- amount\n- currency (at time of transaction)\n- recipientName, recipientAccount, recipientSortCode, recipientBank\n- description\n- reference (auto-generated e.g. ACB-2026-XXXXX)\n- balanceBefore, balanceAfter\n- createdAt\n\n---\n\n## Auth Flow\n\n### Sign Up (/signup)\n1. Full Name, Email, Phone Number (with country code selector), Password, Confirm Password, Currency\n2. Submit \342\206\222 redirect to /verify-method\n3. User selects OTP delivery method \342\206\222 OTP sent \342\206\222 /verify\n4. Enter OTP \342\206\222 if valid: account created, sort code + account number generated, session started \342\206\222 /dashboard\n\n### Login (/login)\n1. Email + Password\n2. Submit \342\206\222 validate credentials \342\206\222 redirect to /verify-method\n3. User selects OTP delivery method \342\206\222 OTP sent \342\206\222 /verify\n4. Enter OTP \342\206\222 if valid: session started \342\206\222 /dashboard\n\n---\n\n## Pages & Features\n\n### 1. Login Page (/login)\n- AdrieChartered logo + tagline\n- Email + Password\n- \"Sign In\" button\n- Link to Sign Up\n\n### 2. Sign Up Page (/signup)\n- Full Name\n- Email\n- Phone Number (country code dropdown + number input, default +44 \360\237\207\254\360\237\207\247)\n- Password + Confirm Password\n- Currency selector (flag + code + name, no African currencies)\n- \"Create Account\" button\n- Link to Login\n\n### 3. OTP Method Selection (/verify-method)\n- Three large cards: Email | WhatsApp | SMS\n- Each shows masked destination\n- \"Continue\" button sends OTP and goes to /verify\n\n### 4. OTP Verification (/verify)\n- \"Code sent via [method] to [masked destination]\"\n- 6 digit input boxes, auto-focus, auto-submit\n- 60s resend countdown\n- \"Change method\" link\n\n### 5. Dashboard (/dashboard)\n- Greeting: \"Good morning/afternoon/evening, [First Name]\"\n- Account card:\n  - Account Number: XXXX XXXX XX\n  - Sort Code: XX-XX-XX\n  - Balance: [Symbol] X,XXX.XX (large)\n  - Currency badge with flag\n- Action buttons: \"Add Money\" | \"Send Money\"\n- Recent 5 transactions\n- Bottom nav: Home, Send, History, Profile\n\n### 6. Add Money (/dashboard/fund)\n- Amount input with currency symbol\n- Description (optional)\n- \"Add Money\" button\n- Updates MongoDB balance\n- Saves credit transaction\n- Success modal\n\n### 7. Send Money (/dashboard/transfer)\n- Recipient Account Number\n- Recipient Sort Code (auto-formats XX-XX-XX as user types)\n- Select Bank dropdown (UK banks only):\n  Barclays, HSBC, Lloyds, NatWest, Santander, Halifax,\n  Nationwide, Monzo, Starling, Revolut, Metro Bank,\n  TSB, Virgin Money, Co-operative Bank, First Direct, Chase UK\n- Recipient Name\n- Amount (with currency symbol)\n- Description / Reference\n- \"Send Money\" button\n- Validates sufficient balance\n- Deducts from MongoDB balance\n- Auto-generates reference: ACB-2026-XXXXX\n- Saves debit transaction\n- Success modal showing reference number + two share buttons:\n  - \360\237\223\261 Send via WhatsApp (wa.me pre-filled message)\n  - \360\237\222\254 Send via SMS (sms: pre-filled message)\n\nDebit alert message:\n  \"DEBIT ALERT \342\200\224 AdrieChartered\n  Ref: ACB-2026-XXXXX\n  Amount: [Symbol]X,XXX.XX\n  Acct: ****XXXX | Sort: XX-XX-XX\n  To: [Recipient Name] | [Bank]\n  Desc: [Description]\n  Date: DD/MM/YYYY HH:MM\n  Bal: [Symbol]XX,XXX.XX\n  AdrieChartered \342\200\224 Banking Built Around You\"\n\n### 8. Transaction History (/dashboard/history)\n- Paginated (10 per page)\n- Each item: Credit\360\237\237\242/Debit\360\237\224\264 badge, amount + symbol, recipient/source, bank, reference, date DD/MM/YYYY, time, description\n- Filter tabs: All | Credits | Debits\n- Search by name, reference, or description\n- Empty state if no transactions\n\n### 9. Profile (/dashboard/profile)\n- Initials avatar (light blue)\n- Full Name, Email, Phone Number\n- Account Number (tap to copy)\n- Sort Code (tap to copy)\n- Member since (DD/MM/YYYY)\n- Currency section: current currency + flag, \"Change Currency\" button \342\206\222 modal with full currency list\n- Logout \342\206\222 clears session \342\206\222 /login\n\n---\n\n## API Routes\n\n- POST /api/auth/signup \342\206\222 create user\n- POST /api/auth/login \342\206\222 verify credentials\n- POST /api/auth/send-otp \342\206\222 send OTP via chosen method (email/whatsapp/sms)\n- POST /api/auth/verify-otp \342\206\222 validate OTP, start session\n- POST /api/auth/resend-otp \342\206\222 regenerate + resend via same method\n- GET /api/user/me \342\206\222 user data, balance, currency\n- PATCH /api/user/currency \342\206\222 update currency\n- POST /api/transactions/fund \342\206\222 credit\n- POST /api/transactions/transfer \342\206\222 debit + generate reference\n- GET /api/transactions \342\206\222 paginated + filtered + searchable\n\n---\n\n## Security & UX\n- Passwords hashed with bcrypt (salt rounds: 12)\n- OTPs hashed with bcrypt before storing\n- Protected routes via Next.js middleware\n- Loading spinners on all async buttons\n- Toast notifications for all errors and successes:\n  - Wrong OTP, Expired OTP, Insufficient balance,\n    Transfer success, Currency changed, OTP sent\n- Amounts always 2 decimal places with thousands separator\n- Dates always DD/MM/YYYY (UK format)\n- Sort code auto-formatted XX-XX-XX as user types\n- Account number masked on card, full in profile\n- Multiple users fully supported \342\200\224 each sees only their own data\n\n---\n\n## Environment Variables (.env.local)\nMONGODB_URI=your_mongodb_connection_string\nNEXTAUTH_SECRET=your_secret\nNEXTAUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000\n\n# Email (Nodemailer)\nEMAIL_HOST=smtp.gmail.com\nEMAIL_PORT=587\nEMAIL_USER=your_email@gmail.com\nEMAIL_PASS=your_gmail_app_password\n\n# Twilio (SMS + WhatsApp)\nTWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=your_twilio_sid\nTWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=your_twilio_auth_token\nTWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER=+1xxxxxxxxxx\nTWILIO_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=whatsapp:+14155238886"
