    modified_response: "I will create the backend database layer `/src/db.ts` which manages either a live Mongoose/MongoDB connection if `MONGODB_URI` is provided, or seamlessly falls back to a locally persistent JSON-based database (`./adrie_db.json`) if it\'s missing. This guarantees proper mock functionality out-of-the-box in the preview environment while supporting full database integration."
