  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining State Management**\n\nI\'m making progress. I\'m focusing on `HistoryView.tsx`. I\'ve decided to manage transaction selection locally within the component. I\'m going to introduce `useState` to manage a `selectedTx` variable, initially null. I\'ll add an `onClick` handler to each transaction item within the map function to update this state.\n\n\n**Enhancing HistoryView Design**\n\nI\'m now focused on the visual design and UX of `HistoryView`. I\'ve added a `cursor-pointer` class to the `<tr>` element to make the entire row clickable and visually enhance the interaction. I\'m also planning to render more informative details within each row, like the recipient/sender\'s bank and sort code. I\'m incorporating a transaction details modal, conditionally rendered based on the `selectedTx` state, and I\'m keen to design this modal with a premium aesthetic.\n\n\n**Designing Transaction Details**\n\nI\'ve been working on the transaction details modal. I\'ve added a colored bar at the top, and a button to close the modal. I\'m focusing on the visual hierarchy now, with a centered header, and a circular icon representing transaction type, which I\'m styling and coloring appropriately. I want a clean, concise layout.\n\n\n**Finalizing Display Elements**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the display elements of the transaction details within the modal. I\'m dynamically rendering the transaction amount with appropriate styling based on the transaction type, using a ternary operator for the sign and color. I\'ve also incorporated the currency symbol and format the amount to two decimal places. I\'m focusing on ensuring data clarity and visual appeal. I\'ve also added clearance ID display.\n\n\n**Detailing Additional Information**\n\nI\'m now detailing additional information in the transaction modal. I\'ve added displays for reference, authorized account, depositing institution/destination bank, and clearing sort code. I\'m dynamically displaying the recipient account if present. I\'m also ensuring the layout is readable and the design is premium.\n\n\n**Adding Account Details**\n\nI\'ve just added the display of the recipient account, making sure to handle the display of partial account numbers, where appropriate, by masking all but the last four digits. I\'m also now displaying the timestamp of the transaction, formatted for the user\'s convenience, and I\'m ensuring all the information is clearly presented. I am also working on rendering the transaction narrative.\n\n\n**Implementing Transaction Narrative**\n\nI\'m now incorporating the transaction narrative. I\'m adding a display element for the description, defaulting to \"Direct electronic authorization cleared\" if the description is unavailable. I\'m ensuring this information is integrated seamlessly within the existing design of the transaction details modal.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 21
      nanos: 95788616
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
