otection Matrix,\" and the description details dynamic transactional PIN security and a manual 24/7 administrator-cleared clearance queue. I\'ve included a shield icon and \"100%\" for the stat, representing complete asset protection. I\'ve also swapped out the generic \"AC\" logo in the brand header (lines 58-68) for the one generated.\n\n\n"
