er dashboard with \"Go to Dashboard\". I\'m also planning for OTP situations during the standard signup.\n\n\n**Implementing OTP Verification**\n\nI\'m now detailing the OTP verification screen within the onboarding flow. My design includes a \"Verify your number\" screen with a six-digit code input, and a countdown timer. The stepper updates with \"3 - Verify\" active. The graphic will be a digital protective lock. Upon verification, the screen transitions to the Success Screen and then the Dashboard! I\'m also thinking how to better handle persistent state in the `OnboardingView.tsx` component, leveraging Framer Motion for animations.\n\n\n"
