 flag prefix selectors (e.g., `\360\237\207\254\360\237\207\247 +44`, `\360\237\207\272\360\237\207\270 +1`) matching the mockup inputs.\n3. **Step 3: Security & Parameters**\n   * Configures **Guard Passwords**, **Preferred 10-Digit Account Identity** (optional), and the user\'s preselected **Sovereign Currency Denomination** using custom dropdown selectors with flags.\n   * Submitting this stage automates core system validation and registration.\n4. **Step 4: Verify Your Number** *(Identity Gate)*\n   * Shows a beautiful security padlock graphic matching Screen 3.\n   * Displays six rounded input digits boxes `[ \342\200\242 ] [ \342\200\242 ] [ \342\200\242 ] [ \342\200\242 ] [  ] [  ]` with active state transition focuses.\n   * Integrated with active countdown logs: *\"Didn\'t receive the code? Resend (00:26)\"* and immediate phone-number correction edits.\n5. **Step 5: perfect Complete state**\n   * Large checklist matching Screen 5 showing:\n     * *Your account is secure*\n     * *Bank 24/7, anywhere*\n     * *Manage, transfer & grow*\n   * Displays a summary table reporting the status\342\200\224supporting both active sign-ins or Superintendent Akonam\'s compliance staging queue from our prior setup!\n"
